        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Apply Claw skill artifacts",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nImplements the first follow-up track from openclaw/rfcs#27 for Claw skill artifacts, stacked after #102306.\n\n- lets `claws apply --yes` install supported `skill` entries through existing OpenClaw skill installers\n- supports ClawHub skill refs plus local/git source skill refs, with owner-qualified ClawHub refs normalized for lock/status checks\n- records skill artifact provenance only for artifacts the apply path actually installed or verified as present\n- preserves fail-closed diagnostics for unsupported skill package sources, malformed ClawHub refs, stale ClawHub lock-only state, and source-origin mismatches\n\n## Stack\n\nBase: `user/giodl/claws-pr7-export` (#102306)\nRFC: openclaw/rfcs#27\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/claws/schema.test.ts src/claws/provenance.test.ts src/claws/artifact-installers.test.ts src/claws/workspace.test.ts src/claws/lifecycle-state.test.ts src/state/openclaw-state-db.test.ts src/cli/claws-cli.test.ts src/claws/lifecycle.e2e.test.ts`\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/claws/provenance.test.ts src/claws/artifact-installers.test.ts src/cli/claws-cli.test.ts src/claws/lifecycle.e2e.test.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `node scripts/check-no-conflict-markers.mjs`\n- `codex review -c model=gpt-5.5 --uncommitted` -> clean: no discrete correctness issues\n\nKnown unrelated blocker:\n\n- `pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit --pretty false` still stops on existing `src/secrets/config-io.ts(12,17)` TS4058 from the inherited stack.\n",
